                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.51/1284a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-12-04T13:00:00-05:00">December 4, 1940—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>216. With Reference to press reports that the Chilean Government has officially
                    suspended amortization of the foreign debt to divert funds to the Exchange
                    Control Commission, please expedite full report.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
